    "created_at": "2025-09-15T06:59:54Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-09-15T06:59:54Z",
    "body": "I encountered the same issue after updating. It took me two days of debugging to identify the root cause - gradually uncommenting code sections since the stack trace wasn't particularly helpful.\nThe crash appears to be caused by version incompatibility between the Calf dependency and Kotlin/Compose versions. Even looking at @SuperG33K's detailed logs, the actual cause (version mismatch) isn't immediately obvious from the error message.\nSuggestion for maintainers: It would be incredibly helpful to have clearer error messages or validation checks when version incompatibilities occur. Something like \"Calf 0.8.0 requires Compose 1.8.2+\" would save developers significant debugging time. The current IrLinkageError doesn't clearly indicate it's a version compatibility issue.",
